# OboxSTEAM Mobile — Project Context

> Load when working on features, auth, routing, or API wiring. Engineering: `expo-engineering-rule.mdc`. UI: `styling-rule.mdc`. Endpoints: `src/lib/api/**` + `api-spec.mdc`. Agent entry: `AGENTS.md`.

---

## What this repo is

**OboxSTEAM.Mobile** — Expo (React Native) app sharing the same backend as `OboxSTEAM.FE` (`EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL`). Web FE stays on VPS; this app is Android-first (Expo Go / EAS APK).

**In scope (v2):** Parent UI overhaul (home / child detail / enrollment as needed); weekly schedule (`GET /api/schedules/weekly`) for Parent + Student; Mentor QR rotate + Student QR check-in; Mentor class-moment capture (`POST /api/media/upload`); role gate after `me`; today’s check-in status on Parent child detail (after QR). Same design tokens for all roles.

**Out of scope:** Parent payment CTA; parent photo gallery; session `evidence` on phone; full LMS; Manager / Expert chrome; inventing mobile-only endpoints; copying FE `components/ui`; shared npm with FE.

---

## Actors (mobile)

| Actor | Mobile treatment |
|-------|------------------|
| **Parent** | Children home + progress overhaul, notifications, profile; Lịch + child switcher; check-in status add-on |
| **Student** | Thin — schedule + QR check-in |
| **Mentor** | Thin — QR rotate + class-moment capture (`media/upload`, not evidence) |
| Other roles | “Dùng website” + logout — `blocked` pattern |

**Parent–Child linking:** Parent sees linked children via `GET /api/parent/links`. Link/approve/magic-login/complete-profile flows mirror FE Parent dialogs as RN screens when exposed.

---

## Product domain (short)

OboxSTEAM is a Vietnamese STEAM learning platform. Mobile v2: Parent progress UX + weekly schedule; Student schedule/check-in; Mentor QR + class-moment capture. Payments, galleries, session evidence, and LMS stay on the **web FE**.

---

## Routing (Expo Router)

```text
app/
├── (auth)/
│   └── login.tsx
├── (guest)/
│   └── welcome.tsx
├── (app)/                        → tabs after auth (Parent today)
│   ├── _layout.tsx
│   ├── children/
│   │   ├── index.tsx             → children list
│   │   └── [studentId]/
│   │       ├── index.tsx         → child progression
│   │       └── enrollments/[enrollmentId].tsx
│   ├── notifications.tsx
│   └── profile.tsx
├── blocked.tsx                   → non-supported role
└── _layout.tsx
```

v2: role-based root after `me` — Parent → children home; Student → schedule/check-in; Mentor → session tools; others → `blocked`. Parent tabs add **Lịch** when Schedule ships.

Deep links (as needed): magic-login, approve-link → `expo-linking`. No parent payment CTA on mobile (out of scope).

